<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>灵巫无限闪避按键宏</Major>
    <Description>如题，这是一个使用闪避速杀按键宏。无限闪。全部只需单手操作即可，非常无脑休闲，深坑105层基本很难超过1分半，幽暗城全程领跑，罗盘不能无脑挂机，单手围着地图绕圈圈即可，当然，你非要罗盘挂机就对着一个墙一直翻滚也可以打。</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 30 1
Delay 5
KeyDown 44 1
Delay 5
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 5
GoWhile 3 100
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 5
KeyDown 31 1
Delay 5
KeyUp 31 1
Delay 5
KeyDown 32 1
Delay 5
KeyUp 32 1
Delay 5
KeyDown 33 1
Delay 5
KeyUp 33 1
Delay 5
RightDown 1
Delay 5
RightUp 1
Delay 5</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Diablo IV</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>